    "body": "Hi @taguacil — thanks for the detailed report and the self-contained reproducer!\n\nI'd like to take this one. I'll look into using strict JSON parsing for the final aggregated message in `generate_from_stream` / `AIMessageChunk.init_tool_calls`, so truncated tool-call arguments land in `invalid_tool_calls` instead of silently becoming a valid-looking `tool_call`.\n",
